  "name": "Disease Use (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thief with this talent can apply filth from garbage, a sewer, a city street, a polluted area, or long-unwashed clothing or fur to a weapon as a standard action. Doing so causes the weapon to inflict filth fever on its next strike. The thief does not risk exposure to this disease unless she is damaged by the weapon. After a successful attack with the weapon, the filth is dispersed and must be reapplied.</p>",
